            "notes": "Round 1-2 build code: 1KCQB\n\nNote that we don't really go in much the first two rounds, after which is where this build really starts to kick (hah) off. Until we get the combination of our first two powers, we mostly focus AP to heal and get more cash early, with some added survivability and limited WP. \n\nDespite largely being a kick/melee focused build, we're not going to be getting [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) until round 7, if even at all. The other powers are just too valuable. Get [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) to help your self-sustain/survivability. You *could* get [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) first if you're confident in your ability to survive without the self-heal, though I usually don't.",
