            "notes": "Finally, we start to be unleashed! With both [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) and [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) we basically get a *bunch* of lifesteal, which is pretty essential for a melee playstyle.\n\nThough [Golden Monk](item_559b91a0-840b-4027-b99c-c5e6b609ae7c) is a GREAT item for our build, I think it's worth waiting another round to get it rather than getting it now and potentially only getting three items total, since [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) is too essential to not get and we'd end up wanting both. We still have decent survivability, especially given our powers, and [Hiking Hoverboots](item_158611dd-147a-4375-a16a-565aa4f5f7de)'s move speed gives us a bit more leniency through mobility.",
