            "created_at": "2025-08-07T01:09:58.347884+00:00",
            "notes": "The final two powers are a choice between three different options, though I have listed ones I'd recommend going with, and the other choices under optional. Overall, all power choices are fun in their own ways. [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) gives you more healing and stay potential and lets you take riskier positions more often since you'll be able to get out of them, [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) lets you reposition yourself to places you otherwise wouldn't be able to reach, as well as being able to stun/approach the enemy quickly if they're backing up out of your melee reach, and [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) gives your already-high survivability an even bigger boost, letting you stay up in fights you *really* have no business living through. \n\n[Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) mixed with [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) gives you great burst healing ability, or the option to use your ult as a \"get away free\" card while still preserving most of your ult charge, in addition to gaining a lot of overhealth. (Note that the timing with [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) is more lax due to [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) increasing your ult's duration)\n\nI prefer the above strategy over the other optional powers here, but both [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) and [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) do work really well with this build. But, in turn, the items you'll wanna take shift if you choose them: \n- [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44): Replace [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) with [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48), then take [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) and [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) instead of the two blue not marked important.\n- [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130): This stays mostly the same, though what you replace [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) with depends. If you want more survivability, take [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8), but if you want more pure WP, then the choice is between [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) if you want the armor for extra melee dmg, (this only applies when you also have [Keepsake of Chaos](item_5f5c7c4c-a559-43a0-9794-bdb866d2327e)), or [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) for doing a lot more dmg, though you could also take [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if you don't have 14k. Note that this build naturally takes [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) in a later round, so you can pick up one of the other items later if you don't take them now. \n\nOptional items can replace/be swapped with items not marked as important if you want.",
