            "notes": "Taking [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) for its added survivability and bit of WP. This item doesn't have armor, however, so if you'd rather take an item that helps with your melee dmg then you can pick [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) instead this round, or take [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) over one of the blue items. \n\nYou can swap between the blue items listed if you'd prefer something else.\n\nIf you took [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44): Since you'll have [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)'s AS and MS, both blue items aren't necessary for you here, so take [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) and [Keepsake of Chaos](item_5f5c7c4c-a559-43a0-9794-bdb866d2327e) instead - though you could optionally choose [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) over the former if you wanted.\n\nAs for [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) havers, the only thing to keep in mind is that the armor from [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) only applies extra melee dmg if you have another 25 from another item, like [Keepsake of Chaos](item_5f5c7c4c-a559-43a0-9794-bdb866d2327e). If you don't have 25 armor from something else, stick with [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).",
