            "notes": "The final round, and with it, the final build!\n\nDepending on what two of the three optional final powers you've taken for yourself, this build shifts a bit:\n- [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) and [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44): I'd highly recommend taking [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) in one of the empty item slots, as your jump-kick will actually apply the item's move speed, unlike discord or harmony orb. For the final slot, either take [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) if you want more survivability or [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) (or its cheaper alternatives in optional items) for better DPS. \n- [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) and [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130): Easy; take [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) and [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or its alternatives. If you *really* want extra move speed, you can take [Hiking Hoverboots](item_158611dd-147a-4375-a16a-565aa4f5f7de) instead, but I wouldn't recommend it most of the time, unless you really like to hover. \n-  [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) and [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130): Remove [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) from the listed items, and take [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d), [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) and [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) (or its alternatives) in the final slots.",
